        "TileImage": "$($repository a4045207-4cf4-4c8c-b847-f02068021011).Image",
        "Description": "47, it&apos;s time. We found him.\r\rYour target is Jim Murphy, the leader of Operation Skyfall. This is it. We&apos;ve learned that he is currently staying at Haven Island, Maldives, along with his two undercover bodyguards who are also targets. You will find Murphy in an underground facility below the villa.\r\rWe&apos;ve prepared a seaplane for you to make your exit. Today is the day those bastards get what they deserve.\r\rIt&apos;s time to finish what we started.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
